Ref: staff-room
Actor: alice
Participant: bob
Title: Staff Room
Description: Private discussion for Alice and Bob
At: 2026-08-01T09:10:00+10:00

-- 110-staff-welcome.event --
Op: forum.thread.create
Ref: staff-welcome
Actor: alice
Topic: staff-room
At: 2026-08-01T09:15:00+10:00

Welcome to the staff room. This conversation is for Alice and Bob.

-- 111-bob-welcome-reply.event --
